{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And he entreated.</b> To remove the swarm at that specific time which he had fixed and in that specific manner which he had announced to Pharaoh — as it says, <i>וַיָּסַר הֶעָרֹב</i> (\"and He removed the swarm\"), not that they would perish and die as happened with the frogs. This was indicated by his saying <i>וַיַּעַשׂ ה' כִּדְבַר מֹשֶׁה</i> (Exodus 8:27) — in the manner of the plague's removal and at its appointed time."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:51.659020424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}